{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 44, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL QUESTIONS ABOUT THE NATURE OF AUTHORITY AND THE ROLE OF INDIVIDUALS IN SOCIETY. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE SEEN AS A CALL TO ACTION AGAINST UNJUST LAWS, ENCOURAGING PEOPLE TO STAND UP FOR WHAT THEY BELIEVE IN AND FIGHT AGAINST INJUSTICE. HOWEVER, IT CAN ALSO BE INTERPRETED AS A RECIPE FOR ANARCHY, WHERE INDIVIDUALS ARE ENCOURAGED TO DISREGARD THE RULE OF LAW AND DO AS THEY PLEASE.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" OVERLOOKS THE COMPLEXITIES OF THE LEGAL SYSTEM AND THE PROCESS OF CHANGING LAWS. IN A DEMOCRATIC SOCIETY, THERE ARE ESTABLISHED CHANNELS FOR CHALLENGING AND CHANGING LAWS THAT ARE DEEMED UNJUST OR UNFAIR. BY ENCOURAGING PEOPLE TO SIMPLY DISREGARD THE LAW, THIS SENTENCE IGNORES THE IMPORTANCE OF WORKING WITHIN THE SYSTEM TO EFFECT CHANGE. ADDITIONALLY, IT DOES NOT PROVIDE ANY GUIDANCE ON HOW TO DETERMINE WHETHER A LAW IS \"BAD\" OR HOW TO DECIDE WHAT TO DO INSTEAD OF FOLLOWING IT.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -2.455681169521995e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -1.0728830375228426e-06}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -8.22540732769994e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.0010343207977712154}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.34958186745643616}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0009134411229752004}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -9.775113539944869e-06}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -9.536738616588991e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " YOU", "logprob": -1.1920928244535389e-07}, {"token": " SHOU